  "Soleil ou lampes fluorescentes : réceptions parasites.": "Sunlight or fluorescent lights: false signals.",
  "Ancienne syntaxe IRremote (irrecv.decode(&results)) : les versions 3 et suivantes utilisent IrReceiver.": "Old IRremote syntax (irrecv.decode(&results)): version 3 and later use IrReceiver.",
  "Touches": "Keys",
