  "Alésage (mm)": "Bore (mm)",
  "Diamètre de tige (mm)": "Rod diameter (mm)",
  "Course (mm)": "Stroke (mm)",
  "Masse mobile (kg)": "Moving mass (kg)",
  "Charge contre la sortie (N)": "Load against extension (N)",
  "Poussée théorique à {0} bar : {1} N en sortie, {2} N en rentrée.": "Theoretical force at {0} bar: {1} N extending, {2} N retracting.",
  "Pression du réseau (bar)": "Supply pressure (bar)",
